# Allow-list: ignore everything, then allow only the files below. Recordings, spreadsheets, BirdNET caches, the
# old private environment folder (.yipnet_env), outputs and demo_app/final_tool_local.pkl (a model saved on your own data, which
# holds your recordings' BirdNET numbers) can never be committed by accident, even if they are in this folder.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!LICENSE
!requirements.txt
!requirements-app.txt
!start_yipnet.py
!START_YipNET_Windows.bat
!START_YipNET_Mac.command
!YipNET.ipynb
!demo_app/app.py
!demo_app/index.html
!demo_app/README.md
!demo_app/final_tool.pkl
!demo_sounds/tone.wav
!demo_sounds/white_noise.wav
